# Compiler output from tsconfig.node.json (composite builds emit these next
# to vite.config.ts). They were committed once, and because Vite resolves
# vite.config.js BEFORE vite.config.ts, the stale compiled copy silently
# became the real config — pinning base to a hardcoded /Reactor-Attractor/
# while edits to the .ts did nothing.
vite.config.js
vite.config.d.ts
